1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,280
Inside ancient wooden logs, scientists discovered a terrifying cosmic crime scene.

2
00:00:04,330 --> 00:00:08,670
In the year 774, something hit Earth with massive invisible radiation.

3
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:12,810
Japanese researchers sliced open centuries-old cedar trees to examine their growth rings.

4
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:16,540
They found a spike of Carbon-14 twenty times higher than normal.

5
00:00:16,930 --> 00:00:20,810
Pause the video—can you guess what created this massive energy burst?

6
00:00:21,010 --> 00:00:24,340
It was the most violent solar superflare in human history.

7
00:00:24,750 --> 00:00:28,410
The blast was double the strength of any solar storm ever recorded.

8
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:32,100
If this same exact event hit our planet today...

9
00:00:32,580 --> 00:00:36,960
It would instantly fry every satellite, power grid, and internet connection worldwide.

10
00:00:37,010 --> 00:00:40,470
Leaving modern civilization in pitch darkness, buried forever...
